ow: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar patterns can occur due to seasonal demand or budget cycles. Small amounts near the limit do not prove violations, as prices may naturally approach the threshold.\nWhat can be checked: Check if multiple contracts cover the same need. Review awardee A’s contracts for repeated purchases. Verify if December’s contracts were part of a planned budget cycle.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["3NJYrRnIiH59Zh%2FyRJgM8w%3D%3D","USySrSGumGF6nTs9LZ9RhQ%3D%3D","WcXL4OO9inQadbH3CysQuQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}